<p>This checklist is the one we use when we take over a new restaurant account. Work through it top to bottom.</p>
<h2>1. Claim, verify and own the listing</h2>
<p>Search your restaurant's name on Google Maps. If the listing shows "Own this business?", claim it and complete verification. Then make sure the right people have access:</p>
